sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin
  participant FE as AdminPortal
  participant C as UserController
  participant S as UserService
  participant R as UserRepository
  Admin->>FE: Fill name, email, initial password, role
  FE->>C: POST /api/v1/users (JWT, ADMIN)
  C->>S: create(RegisterRequest)
  S->>R: existsByEmailIgnoreCase(email)
  alt email already registered
    S-->>C: 409 Email is already registered
  else new email
    S->>S: BCrypt hash, mustChangePassword = true
    S->>R: save(user)
    S-->>C: UserResponse (no token)
    C-->>FE: 201 Created
  end
